{"t":"EXE","n":"Expand Energy Corporation","ex":"NasdaqGS","cur":"USD","px":80.79,"chg":-0.48,"chgPct":-0.00591,"prev":81.27,"dayH":82.24,"dayL":80.46,"w52H":126.62,"w52L":80.46,"vol":4035991,"avgVol":2500080,"mcap":18659043328,"pe":6.97,"fpe":10.49,"eps":11.59,"feps":7.7,"pb":0.96,"div":2.3,"divY":0.0285,"beta":0.37,"short":11680082,"shortPct":0.0507,"shortRatio":3.58,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Energy","sKo":"에너지","i":"Oil & Gas E&P","iKo":"석유 및 가스 E&P","city":"Spring","emp":1600,"web":"https://www.expandenergy.com","sum":"Expand Energy Corporation operates as an independent natural gas production company in the United States. The company engages in acquisition, exploration, and development of properties to produce oil, natural gas, and natural gas liquids. It holds interests in the Marcellus Shale in the northern Appalachian Basin in Pennsylvania; the Marcellus and Utica Shales in Ohio and West Virginia; and the Haynesville and Bossier Shales in Louisiana and Texas. Expand Energy Corporation was formerly known as Chesapeake Energy Corporation and changed its name to Expand Energy Corporation in October 2024. The company was founded in 1989 and is based in Spring, Texas.","sumKo":"Expand Energy Corporation은 미국에서 독립적인 천연가스 생산 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 이 회사는 석유, 천연가스, 천연가스 액체를 생산하기 위한 자산의 취득, 탐사 및 개발에 참여하고 있습니다. 펜실베니아 북부 애팔래치아 분지의 마셀러스 셰일(Marcellus Shale)에 지분을 보유하고 있습니다. 오하이오와 웨스트버지니아의 Marcellus와 Utica 셰일; 그리고 루이지애나와 텍사스의 Haynesville과 Bossier Shales가 있습니다. Expand Energy Corporation은 이전에 Chesapeake Energy Corporation으로 알려졌으며 2024년 10월에 이름을 Expand Energy Corporation으로 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1989년에 설립되었으며 텍사스 주 스프링에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":9892000000,"ni":4869000000},{"y":2023,"rev":3547000000,"ni":2419000000},{"y":2024,"rev":2969000000,"ni":-714000000},{"y":2025,"rev":8476000000,"ni":1819000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":2305000000,"ni":553000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":3315000000,"ni":1159000000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":1830000000,"ni":522000000}